msgid "功能指南"
msgstr "Feature Guide"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:4
#: aa812b671d764c3792ee5ebccd7bb26f
msgid ""
"这里按 NepTrainKit 左侧页面顺序回答“我正在这个页面，具体该查哪一项”。首页负责"
"选择 大方向；本页直接给出每个页面最常用的子入口。"
msgstr "This section follows the order of NepTrainKit's left-hand pages and answers a practical question: “I am on this page—what should I look up?” The home page helps you choose a broad direction; this page links directly to the most useful subpages for each screen."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:8
#: e57fd9b84e1745a297926f9f5abe5c1d
msgid "NEP Dataset Display"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:10
#: 1fff78919f7a4c82b057978d61fd62dc
msgid "用于打开结构和训练输出、查看散点图、定位结构、清洗数据和导出子集。"
msgstr "Use it to open structures and training outputs, inspect scatter plots, locate structures, clean data, and export subsets."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:12
#: ffbf4eb131ab4e2bb1eb908c2255f698
msgid "不会打开结构、``nep.txt`` 或训练输出：:doc:`nep-display-open-data`"
msgstr "Cannot open structures, ``nep.txt``, or training outputs: :doc:`nep-display-open-data`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:13
#: 2c286b398da54945ae9c6ab8e381fb52
msgid "不认识图上工具或不清楚 x/y 含义：:doc:`nep-display-main-plot-tools`"
msgstr "Do not recognize a plot tool or are unsure what x/y mean: :doc:`nep-display-main-plot-tools`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:14
#: 2b7be995338c48608c6a5c2615e6c0b1
msgid "想按标签、元素或表达式筛选：:doc:`nep-display-filter`"
msgstr "Want to filter by labels, elements, or expressions: :doc:`nep-display-filter`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:15
#: 644c392758cf427e9be5e0711bcb3e36
msgid "想标记、删除、恢复或导出结构：:doc:`nep-display-structure-tools`"
msgstr "Want to tag, delete, restore, or export structures: :doc:`nep-display-structure-tools`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:16
#: 98123cbebba64b11b7ec0d0413c275a3
msgid "页面没图、数量不对或工具不可用：:doc:`nep-display-status-and-errors`"
msgstr "The page has no plot, the count is wrong, or a tool is unavailable: :doc:`nep-display-status-and-errors`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:17
#: 429ecf6361f84be19bc350c2f98fc6e7
msgid "先看完整页面逻辑：:doc:`NEP-dataset-display`"
msgstr "Start with the complete page logic: :doc:`NEP-dataset-display`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:20
#: befb31115821405c889465e64f9d33cb
msgid "训练集评估（Training Set Audit）"
msgstr "Training Set Audit (Training Set Audit)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:22
#: c38e8236ad88446db0b878e1bf869f94
msgid ""
"用于检查当前训练数据快照的标签质量、组成、结构相、磁类型和需要人工复核的问"
"题。"
msgstr "Use it to inspect label quality, composition, structural phases, magnetic types, and issues that require manual review in the current training-data snapshot."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:24
#: 0926de43bf2c433cae6d8de171211d57
msgid "第一次进入，先处理阻塞项：:doc:`training-audit-overview`"
msgstr "On your first visit, handle blocking issues first: :doc:`training-audit-overview`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:25
#: 351c407c39684b72b6cc0638d046a70c
msgid "查看组分、标签范围和数据分布：:doc:`training-audit-data-map`"
msgstr "Inspect composition, label ranges, and data distributions: :doc:`training-audit-data-map`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:26
#: a3fd02a2bef945498c00717f6ac3cfe3
msgid "检查局域环境证据：:doc:`training-audit-advanced`"
msgstr "Inspect local-environment evidence: :doc:`training-audit-advanced`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:27
#: f33858e923ef42b7aef4eff59264c63c
msgid ""
"核对结构相或磁类型判据：:doc:`training-audit-phase` / :doc:`training-audit-"
"magnetism`"
msgstr "Check phase or magnetic-type criteria: :doc:`training-audit-phase` / :doc:`training-audit-magnetism`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:29
#: 01411065b0564c94a137d8dae70d39fb
msgid ""
"记录人工判断并导出结果：:doc:`training-audit-review-queue` / :doc:`training-"
"audit-report`"
msgstr "Record manual decisions and export results: :doc:`training-audit-review-queue` / :doc:`training-audit-report`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:31
#: 28631fe298924fcd83f1b03eead5bb12
msgid "先理解整页阅读顺序：:doc:`training-set-assessment`"
msgstr "Understand the reading order of the full page first: :doc:`training-set-assessment`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:34
#: 620b3afae6ee407f9ef4c856f98f91fd
msgid "生成数据集"
msgstr "Make Dataset"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:36
#: c204b45e98554839a9f651fdfde99637
msgid "用于从基础结构生成应变、扰动、合金、缺陷、表面、分子或磁性候选构型。"
msgstr "Use it to generate strained, perturbed, alloy, defect, surface, molecular, or magnetic candidate configurations from base structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:38
#: 83100c1154b54f5ba27a27f71c844b3c
msgid "不认识顶部按钮和卡片运行顺序：:doc:`make-dataset`"
msgstr "Do not recognize the top buttons or card execution order: :doc:`make-dataset`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:39
#: 3b09a3b03c25487497c3eb04d07cb7d5
msgid "不知道该选哪张卡：:doc:`make-dataset-cards/index`"
msgstr "Do not know which card to choose: :doc:`make-dataset-cards/index`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:40
#: 78c4b9b9c488439db727b8e1b72581bf
msgid ""
"已经选定卡片，要查参数和原理：从 :doc:`make-dataset-cards/index` 进入对应分类"
"和具体卡片"
msgstr "Have chosen a card and need its parameters and principles: start at :doc:`make-dataset-cards/index`, then open the relevant category and card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:42
#: 4197a61f294b41cb9e31de2bca348699
msgid "想直接参考完整多卡流程：:doc:`make-dataset-cards/recipes`"
msgstr "Want a complete multi-card workflow: :doc:`make-dataset-cards/recipes`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:45
#: 949349ac16c54285b26af8b1a551e9f6
msgid "数据管理（Data Management）"
msgstr "Data Management (Data Management)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:47
#: 1dccf66ae2534e2ea7ef02949b1e113d
msgid ""
"用于记录项目、模型、数据和输出路径之间的关系。先看 :doc:`data-management` 中"
"的推荐记录方式、常用操作和存储位置。它不替代结构文件本身， 也不会自动判断哪一"
"版模型更可靠。"
msgstr "Use it to record relationships between projects, models, data, and output paths. Start with the recommended record format, common operations, and storage locations in :doc:`data-management`. It does not replace the structure files themselves or decide automatically which model version is more reliable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:52
#: 8c2c2b49b03a402e87f557fcbb71c5d4
msgid "设置（Settings）"
msgstr "Settings"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:54
#: a953594a32704f96a23972e80402b786
msgid ""
"用于调整 NEP 后端、绘图、结构显示、NEP89 和更新行为。进入 :doc:`settings` "
"后， 先确认设置影响的是计算、显示还是更新；遇到 CUDA 不可用时先看“NEP 后端”，"
"不要只反复切换 下拉框。"
msgstr "Use it to adjust the NEP backend, plotting, structure display, NEP89, and update behavior. After opening :doc:`settings`, first determine whether a setting affects computation, display, or updates. If CUDA is unavailable, read the “NEP backend” section instead of repeatedly switching the drop-down."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/index.rst:58
#: ba13d80622c74517a9c1c075c8b54b65
msgid ""
"还不知道从哪里开始时，看 :doc:`../quickstart`；已经有候选结构准备送 DFT 时，"
"看 :doc:`../workflows/clean-candidate-structures`。术语不清楚或遇到报错时，直"
"接进入 :doc:`../reference/glossary` 或 :doc:`../reference/troubleshooting`。"
msgstr "If you still do not know where to start, see :doc:`../quickstart`. If you already have candidate structures ready for DFT, see :doc:`../workflows/clean-candidate-structures`. If a term is unclear or an error occurs, go directly to :doc:`../reference/glossary` or :doc:`../reference/troubleshooting`."

